indicators.user:
Fill the indicator record for {{ country }} from the IMF pages below. All values are percentages.
- gdp_growth_forecast_pct: real GDP growth for the current-year projection {{ year }};
- headline_inflation_rate_pct: headline consumer price inflation, annual average, {{ year }};
- central_bank_policy_rate_pct: the policy interest rate set by the national central bank;
- non_performing_loan_ratio: nonperforming loans to total gross loans, latest year shown;
- unemployment_rate_pct: unemployment rate, {{ year }};
- tier_1_capital_ratio: Tier 1 capital to risk-weighted assets, latest year shown.
If a value is not printed in these pages, give null and say why in "reason". Never estimate.
For every value give the year, the PDF page and the table row label exactly as printed.
